{"asset_key":"mn3/env_story_10352210","episode":"mn3","category":"env_story","story_id":"10352210","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1035221001:0":{"text":"これは絶対に両者の関係を現してるわ！","source_cn":"我认为这一定和他们的关系有关！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81983669C792A730","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1035221002:0":{"text":"そうかしら？私にはこれはただの芸術デザインだと思うけど……","source_cn":"是吗？我倒感觉神明是从美学的角度考虑的","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x532BD30A720ECFB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1035221003:0":{"text":"いいえ！神の考えがそんなに単純なはずがない！絶対にもっと深い考えがあるはずよ！","source_cn":"不，神明不会想的那么单一，绝对有更深层次的考量！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2ECD11F056AB61BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1035221004:0":{"text":"いずれにしても、どちらが先に解き明かすか勝負ね！","source_cn":"不如我们来比比，谁能先研究清楚！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x986DFC76A49B1A1C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:冬青学者黛莉":{"text":"学者のデイリー","source":"冬青学者黛莉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:冬青学者莱奥娜":{"text":"学者のレオナ","source":"冬青学者莱奥娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}